{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"sepia-reading","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Sepia Reading","description":"Warm sepia paper tones, easy on the eyes for long reading and writing sessions.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Sepia Reading","path":"themes/sepia-reading.json","uiTheme":"light"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/sepia-reading.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Sepia Reading\",\n  \"type\": \"light\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#f4ecd8\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#433422\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#ebe1c8\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#e2d7bb\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#e2d7bb\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#ebe1c8\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#ddd1b3\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#d4c6a1\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#f9f3e3\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#ebe1c8\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#d6c9a8\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#9c5a2a\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#9c5a2a\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#9c5a2a\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#d4c6a1\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#ddd1b380\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#9c5a2a\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#d6c9a8\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#a4392f\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#5b7a2b\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#8a6a2a\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#a4392f\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8d7f63\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#5b7a2b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a2552a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8a3b52\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#35637a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9c5a2a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a2552a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#35637a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8a3b52\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8a6a2a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#2f6f62\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Sepia Reading\n\nWarm sepia paper tones, easy on the eyes for long reading and writing sessions.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Sepia Reading** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a light theme.\n\nAn original palette by Vyloxi.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#f4ecd8` |\n| Text | `#433422` |\n| Accent | `#9c5a2a` |\n| Keywords | `#8a3b52` |\n| Strings | `#5b7a2b` |\n| Functions | `#9c5a2a` |\n| Types | `#35637a` |\n| Comments | `#8d7f63` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}